  "title": "Langues de Chat",
  "description": "These 'cat's tongues' are delicate buttery cookies made with a cookie press or pastry bag. The ends are dipped in semisweet chocolate. The cookies can also be sandwiched together with chocolate.",
  "authors": [
    "MBMCD"
  ],
